<section class="page-hero"><img class="bg" src="/assets/img/photos/builder-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/builder-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/builder-house.webp 960w" sizes="100vw" width="960" height="639" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.12"><div class="wrap"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span>Services</nav><span class="kicker fade-up">What we do</span><h1 class="fade-up" style="animation-delay:.08s">Oregon Insurance Appraisal Services</h1><p class="lede fade-up" style="animation-delay:.15s">From a single estimate review to full appraisal panel representation and neutral umpire work, every service is built around an accurate, defensible valuation of your Oregon property loss.</p><div class="btn-row fade-up" style="animation-delay:.22s"><a class="btn sun" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn line-w" href="/reach-an-appraiser/">Free claim review</a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="index-list" data-stagger><a class="index-card rv" href="/property-appraisals/appraisal-clause-help/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/meeting.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/meeting-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/meeting.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 240px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><span class="k">Service 01</span><h2>Appraisal Clause Representation</h2><p>We act as the appraiser you name after you or your insurer demands appraisal under the policy.</p></span></a><a class="index-card rv" href="/property-appraisals/home-insurance-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/house-dusk.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/house-dusk-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/house-dusk.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 240px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><span class="k">Service 02</span><h2>Homeowner Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Houses, townhomes and condo units where the insurer’s estimate leaves out real repair costs.</p></span></a><a class="index-card rv" href="/property-appraisals/commercial-hoa-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/commercial-glass.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/commercial-glass-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/commercial-glass.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 240px" width="960" height="541" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><span class="k">Service 03</span><h2>Commercial &amp; HOA Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Retail, office, industrial, multifamily, church and condo association losses with large, complex scopes.</p></span></a><a class="index-card rv" href="/property-appraisals/roof-hail-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-damage.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-damage-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-damage.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 240px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><span class="k">Service 04</span><h2>Roof &amp; Hail Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Wind-lifted shingles, hail bruising east of the Cascades, moss-weakened roofs and repair-vs-replace fights.</p></span></a><a class="index-card rv" href="/property-appraisals/windstorm-tornado-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/coast-waves.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/coast-waves-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/coast-waves.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 240px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><span class="k">Service 05</span><h2>Windstorm &amp; Tornado Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Pacific windstorms, coastal gales and the occasional Oregon tornado: siding, roofing, fences and trees.</p></span></a><a class="index-card rv" href="/property-appraisals/ice-storm-snow-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/ice-storm.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/ice-storm-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/ice-storm.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 240px" width="1024" height="627" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><span class="k">Service 06</span><h2>Ice Storm &amp; Snow Load Appraisal</h2><p>Ice-laden limbs, collapsed gutters, burst pipes and snow-load damage after Oregon winter storms.</p></span></a><a class="index-card rv" href="/property-appraisals/water-damage-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/rain-window.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/rain-window-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/rain-window.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 240px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><span class="k">Service 07</span><h2>Water Damage Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Supply-line leaks, burst pipes, appliance failures and rain intrusion that the carrier scoped too narrowly.</p></span></a><a class="index-card rv" href="/property-appraisals/house-fire-smoke-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/house-fire-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 240px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><span class="k">Service 08</span><h2>Fire &amp; Smoke Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Structure fires, kitchen fires and smoke or soot damage where cleaning was approved instead of replacement.</p></span></a><a class="index-card rv" href="/property-appraisals/wildfire-loss-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/wildfire-aftermath.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/wildfire-aftermath-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/wildfire-aftermath.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 240px" width="1024" height="684" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><span class="k">Service 09</span><h2>Wildfire Loss Appraisal</h2><p>Total losses, partial losses and smoke infiltration from Oregon wildfires, including contents and rebuild costs.</p></span></a><a class="index-card rv" href="/property-appraisals/fallen-tree-appraisal/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/tree-roof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/tree-roof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/tree-roof.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 240px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><span class="k">Service 10</span><h2>Fallen Tree Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Douglas firs and big-leaf maples through roofs, decks and cars after windstorms and ice.</p></span></a><a class="index-card rv" href="/property-appraisals/carrier-estimate-review/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/plans-clipboard.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/plans-clipboard-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/plans-clipboard.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 240px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><span class="k">Service 11</span><h2>Insurance Estimate Review</h2><p>A line-by-line check of the insurer’s estimate before you decide whether to supplement, appraise or settle.</p></span></a><a class="index-card rv" href="/property-appraisals/neutral-umpire-services/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/builder-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/builder-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/builder-house.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 240px" width="960" height="639" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><span class="k">Service 12</span><h2>Umpire Services</h2><p>A neutral umpire for appraisal panels when the two appraisers can’t agree on every item.</p></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap split top"><div class="rv"><span class="kicker">Not sure where to start?</span><h2>Most claims start with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone demands appraisal, it helps to know exactly where the insurer’s estimate falls short and what the gap is worth. A review answers that, and many disputes end there.</p><a class="btn" href="/property-appraisals/carrier-estimate-review/">About estimate reviews <svg class="ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><div class="rv"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for just one part of the process?</summary><div class="a"><p>Yes. Many clients start with an estimate review and decide later whether to demand appraisal.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle residential and commercial claims?</summary><div class="a"><p>Yes: houses, condos, rentals, apartments, retail, office, industrial, churches and associations.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you only handle wildfire claims?</summary><div class="a"><p>No. We handle wind, ice, snow, water, fire, tree, hail and other covered perils across Oregon.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap"><div class="in rv"><div><h2>Settlement short of the repair bill?</h2><p>Send us the insurer’s estimate and your photos. We’ll tell you what we see.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn line" href="/reach-an-appraiser/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></div></section>
